            description: "Horse clans of the endless grass. Their sky-shamans named the falling star the Sky-Father's arrow, loosed to choose one Khagan over all the earth, and the clans rode for the crater the season it fell. They carry their forges on wagons and, in the end, their capital too. Horse archers from the first age, cheap fast riders in every age, wagons that roll where other wheels sink, stake lines instead of stone, and nothing that crawls on tracks.",
